        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 235.57999999999998,
          "end": 239.32,
          "en": "with those file and folder names you see here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 239.32,
          "end": 241.19,
          "en": "And with that, we get the dummy data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 241.19,
          "end": 244,
          "en": "which we will use in this course section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 244,
          "end": 245.14,
          "en": "So now with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 245.14,
          "end": 248.02,
